{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S09、S14等关键转折，Y把人物的心理依据和前后因果压缩得偏短，不如X交代得完整，尤其少了眼下仍然亲近这一事实如何支撑他放下保证的要求。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的交替排布、重点词加亮，让普通观众更容易先抓住人物每一段在想什么；感受文字较小且按音乐进程出现，也让音乐变化和心理变化更容易对上。贯穿全篇的船、水波、漂浮、靠岸等意象，使情绪发展有连续的感官线索，细节也比X更具体。X真正占优的是叙事因果，人物为什么从期待、害怕走到接受，交代得更充分；因此Y整体胜出，但并非每个维度都胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1b1e100-349c-4cc8-8bac-c57c6e15409c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T070938868953Z", "elapsed_seconds": 129.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:11:48.430946+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "53c3dc18509edad8a1bd341b3fcfeb458f18c1d3c87df7e601a1c5a688257606", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web